# The build context only needs the dependency manifest, its lockfile, and the
# optional prebuilt FlashAttention 3 wheel plus its build-time verifier.
# Everything else is bind-mounted at run time, so excluding it keeps the
# context (and rebuild times) tiny.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!wheels
!wheels/**
wheels/*.part*
!scripts/
!scripts/verify_flash_attn3.py
